+/*!
+   \fn bool QCborStreamReader::isNumber() const
+   \since 6.13
+
+   Returns true if the type of the current element is a number: either an
+   integer (unsigned or negative) or an IEEE 754 floating point of any
+   precision (that is, if isInteger(), isFloat16(), isFloat() or isDouble()
+   returns true). If this function returns true, you may call toNumber() to
+   read that value.
+
+   \sa type(), toNumber(), isInteger(), isFloat16(), isFloat(), isDouble()
+ */
